      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Endorsing the Green Transition Act is the only responsible move because staying neutral while ignoring climate change is a moral failure that will permanently damage your brand's reputation.\nWhile some might argue neutrality protects short-term profits, the long-term cost of appearing complicit in fossil-fuel pollution far outweighs any temporary loss of conservative customers.\nYou must take a clear, proactive stance to align with the values of your modern workforce and avoid being labeled as an obstacle to necessary environmental progress.",
